; A pad in one file serves a balance in another, as beancount pads across the files
; of a ledger: `cross_file/pads.bean` pads Assets:Bank for the balance here, and the
; pad here serves the balance of Assets:Cash in that file.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

include "cross_file/pads.bean"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:Bank
1970-01-01 open Assets:Cash
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open

2024-01-02 pad Assets:Cash Equity:Open

2024-01-05 balance Assets:Bank  1000 CNY
